      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focus on reframing your data as a diagnosis that led to a strategic pivot toward more resilient reef interventions rather than framing the 5% progress as a failure. Highlight specific lessons learned and how the fund's expertise will help scale these new approaches to ultimately exceed the 20% target in future districts. While acknowledging the challenge shows humility, it is critical to present a robust implementation theory that proves your team has the capacity to turn minor successes into major ecological breakthroughs.",
